# GLOBEX CORPORATION — STRICT TIME OFF POLICY (2026)
## 1. Annual Vacation
- Entitlement: Globex employees are granted 12 paid vacation days per calendar year.
- Accrual: Leave is accrued strictly at 1.0 day per completed month.
- Carry-Over: Zero (0) carry-over allowed. Unused days are forfeited on December 31st.

## 2. Sick Leave
- Entitlement: Employees receive 5 paid sick days per year.
- Notice: Notice must be submitted 24 hours in advance where possible.

## 3. Holidays
- Official Public Holidays: 8 standard public holidays.
- Floating Holidays: Zero (0) floating holidays are provided by Globex.
